{"surface":"தாங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"தாங்கல்","lemma":"tāṅkal","gloss":"bearing / enduring"}],"gloss":"bearing"},{"surface":"ஒல்லுமோ","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்லுமோ","lemma":"ollumō","gloss":"is it possible?"}],"gloss":"is it possible?"},{"surface":"பூங்குழையோய்","parts":[{"text":"பூங்குழையோய்","lemma":"பூங்குழையோய்","gloss":"oh one with flower-like earrings"}],"gloss":"oh one with flower-like earrings","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எனச்","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"ena","gloss":"thus"},{"text":"ச்","lemma":"c","gloss":"doubled consonant"}],"gloss":"thus"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சொல்லா","parts":[{"text":"சொல்லா","lemma":"sollā","gloss":"before saying"}],"gloss":"before saying"},{"surface":"முன்னர்","parts":[{"text":"முன்னர்","lemma":"muṉṉar","gloss":"before"}],"gloss":"before"},{"surface":"நில்லா","parts":[{"text":"நில்லா","lemma":"nillā","gloss":"not stopping"}],"gloss":"not stopping"},{"surface":"ஆகி","parts":[{"text":"ஆகி","lemma":"āki","gloss":"having become"}],"gloss":"having become"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீர்விலங்கு","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water / tears"},{"text":"விலங்கு","lemma":"vilaṅku","gloss":"obstructing"}],"gloss":"obstructing tears"},{"surface":"அழுதல்","parts":[{"text":"அழுதல்","lemma":"aḻutal","gloss":"weeping"}],"gloss":"weeping"},{"surface":"ஆனா","parts":[{"text":"ஆனா","lemma":"āṉā","gloss":"not ceasing"}],"gloss":"not ceasing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேர்விலங்கின","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"tēr","gloss":"chariot"},{"text":"விலங்கின","lemma":"vilaṅkiṉa","gloss":"obstructed"}],"gloss":"obstructed the chariot"},{"surface":"ஆல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"āl","gloss":"indeed / particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"தெரிவை","parts":[{"text":"தெரிவை","lemma":"terivai","gloss":"young woman"}],"gloss":"young woman's"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eyes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"eyes indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like streaming sapphires, the dark-vined hariali grass, / tender branches shedding their buds, along with female deer, / the male deer leaps in the forest we leave behind. / Having performed our work excellently, we return to that mountain. / 'Is it possible for you to bear this, oh one with flower-like earrings?' / Even before saying this, not stopping, / tears obstructing her sight, weeping without ceasing, / they obstructed the chariot, the young woman's eyes indeed!","translation":"The male deer leaps along with his mate in the forest we leave behind, where the dark-vined hariali grass looks like streaming sapphires and tender branches shed their buds. We are returning to that mountain limit after successfully completing our task. Even before I could ask, 'Oh one with flower-like earrings, is it possible for you to bear this separation?', her eyes, weeping without ceasing and filled with obstructing tears, stood in the way of my chariot!","modern":"நீலமணிகள் ஒழுகுவது போன்ற கரிய கொடிகளையுடைய அறுகம்புல்லையும், அரும்புகள் அவிழ்ந்த மெல்லிய கொம்புகளையும் பிணையோடு கூடி உண்டு ஆண்மான் துள்ளி விளையாடும் காட்டைப் பின்னே தள்ளி, நம் கடமையைச் செவ்வனே முடித்துவிட்டு அந்த மலை எல்லையை நோக்கி வருகின்றோம். 'பூங்குழையணிந்தவளே! என் பிரிவைத் தாங்கிக் கொள்ள உன்னால் இயலுமா?' என்று நான் கேட்பதற்கு முன்னரே, அவளது கண்கள் நில்லாமல் அழுது, பெருகிய கண்ணீரால் வழி மறைத்து, எனது தேரையே தடுத்து நிறுத்திவிட்டன.","explanation":"The hero (தலைவன்) is returning to his beloved after successfully completing his mission in the desert/wasteland (பாலை). He remembers how, as he was about to leave, he wanted to ask her if she could bear the separation. But even before he could speak, her eyes filled with unstoppable tears, which seemed to physically block his chariot from leaving. The imagery of the fertile forest they are passing through, where the male deer leaps happily with his mate amidst lush grass and budding branches, contrasts with the painful memory of his departure. This beautiful pālai poem highlights the intense grief of separation and the deep empathy of the hero who is eager to return to his beloved.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.72],[0.72,1.14],[1.14,1.7],[1.86,2.1],[2.1,2.49],[2.49,2.98],[2.98,3.86],[3.86,4.7],[4.7,4.9],[5.0,5.38],[5.38,5.66],[5.66,6.03],[6.03,6.5],[6.5,7.12],[7.12,7.74],[7.74,8.77],[8.77,9.6],[9.6,9.83],[9.83,10.23],[10.23,10.9],[10.9,11.9],[11.9,12.2],[12.2,12.46],[12.46,12.8],[12.8,13.91],[13.91,14.3],[14.3,14.72],[14.72,15.77],[15.77,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.72],[0.72,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.67,2.0],[2.0,2.39],[2.39,3.28],[3.28,3.99],[3.99,4.7],[4.7,4.96],[5.35,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.6],[6.6,7.9],[7.9,8.17],[8.3,8.72],[8.72,9.3],[9.3,9.75],[9.75,10.2],[10.2,10.75],[11.08,11.7],[11.7,12.9],[12.9,13.3],[13.3,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,15.93],[15.93,16.55],[16.55,17.05],[17.05,17.43],[17.43,17.8]]},"sync":[[["மணி","sapphire"],["வார்ந்தன்ன","like that which streamed"]],[["வார்ந்தன்ன","like that which streamed"]],[["மா","dark"],["கொடி","creeper"]],[["அறுகை","hariali grass"]],[["பிணி","bud"],["கான்","shedding"]],[["மென்","soft"],["கொம்பு","twig"]],[["பிணையொடு","with the female deer"]],[["மார்ந்த","that fed upon"]],[["மான்","deer"]],[["ஏறு","male deer"],["உகளும்","leaping"]],[["கானம்","forest"]],[["பிற்பட","to be left behind"]],[["வினைநலம்","excellence of work"]],[["படீஇ","having achieved"]],[["வருதும்","we will return"]],[["வருதும்","we will return"],["அவ்வரைத்","to that mountain limit"]],[["தாங்கல்","bearing"]],[["ஒல்லுமோ","is it possible?"]],[["பூங்குழையோய்","oh one with flower-like earrings"]],[["பூங்குழையோய்","oh one with flower-like earrings"],["எனச்","thus"]],[["சொல்லா","before saying"]],[["முன்னர்","before"]],[["நில்லா","not stopping"]],[["ஆகி","having become"]],[["நீர்விலங்கு","obstructing tears"]],[["நீர்விலங்கு","obstructing tears"],["அழுதல்","weeping"]],[["அழுதல்","weeping"],["ஆனா","not ceasing"]],[["தேர்விலங்கின","obstructed the chariot"]],[["தேர்விலங்கின","obstructed the chariot"],["ஆல்","indeed"]],[